namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamMeshModifierJelly {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/MeshModifier/DreamMeshModifierJelly.h#DreamMeshModifierJelly
    src   "A wobble: the mesh on a lattice of control points held by springs (FDreamJellySprings), which lag behind as the widget\nmoves and spring back, squash while the widget is pressed and bounce when it is let go, and stretch after a drag. The\nmesh is cut and bent as the warp does it (FDreamMeshDeform), so the corners of a rect block and the glyphs of a text\nbend with it. Still and untouched, it costs nothing.\n\nPresses and drags reach it as they reach any component of a widget that takes pointer events -- the widget must be hit\nby the pointer -- and it passes them on: a button under it still clicks, a scroll view above it still scrolls."
    text  "一种晃动：网格建立在由弹簧（FDreamJellySprings）保持的控制点晶格上，这些点会滞后于控件\n的移动再弹回，控件被按下时被压扁、松开时弹跳，拖动后则被拉伸。网格\n像扭曲那样被切割和弯曲（FDreamMeshDeform），因此矩形块的角和文本的字形也会\n随之弯曲。静止未受触及时，它不产生任何开销。\n\n按下和拖动会像到达任何接受指针事件的控件组件那样到达它——控件必须被指针\n命中——并将它们传递下去：它下面的按钮仍然可以点击，它上面的滚动视图仍然可以滚动。"
    state machine
}

